<hr />
<p style="text-align: center;">A story about everything that could possibly go wrong, going wrong &#8212; except the one thing that didn't.</p>
<hr />
<p><strong>SOURCES:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Link <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Anacortes_Refinery_31904.JPG">here</a>. All other images are mine; I release them under CC 3.0.</li>
<li>Inspired by real events surrounding a real steel I-beam.</li>
</ul>
<hr />
<p>I don't expect this to be a popular one. It's one of those things I just had to write out for myself, to get it out of my head &#8212; me posting it is more a formality than anything else.</p>
